00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.870
I mustn't lose my composure over anything.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:06.140
Well said.

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:07.400
Talking like a true man.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.070
And here come Ruber's men.

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:35.670
T-This is bad!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:36.660
I-I know!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.610
All right!

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:47.140
But...

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:55.220
Hold on tight, okay, Prince?

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:55.950
