00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.430
Once I have the money,

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:42.830
I'm going to kiss this miserable life goodbye
and find a better life on a different planet.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.560
Well, it's nothing a person
like you would understand.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:48.300
I see.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:51.630
But, I'm actually envious of you.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.260
Huh? Why?

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:56.800
Because you're in control of your own destiny.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.580
Now that's something I don't understand.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.600
Go!

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.110
Go!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.890
I knew it!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.930
That Rita! She betrayed us!

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:20.700
Hurry!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.270
Do whatever it takes to catch
them before the police do!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.470
They're worth a hundred thousand
credits! A hundred thousand!

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:31.970
Kei, I'm borrowing your gun.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.040
Why you!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.690
Whoa, you're pretty good.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:57.100
Shoot.

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:57.930
They found us already.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.930
Rita, head towards that valley!

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:00.940
Got it!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.370
Damn it!

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.680
What a meddlesome place for them to hide!

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:10.340
Boss!

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:11.290
Above us!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.010
What?

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:41.780
There they are!

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.040
Listen, I want them captured alive!

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:48.890
Damn it.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.550
We can't let those guys take them.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:52.420
Come!

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:56.230
Come on, Prince!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.760
Use me to climb onto the cliff!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.700
Kid, let go!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.810
Your gun! Give me your gun!

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:16.240
Hurry!

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:20.820
Kei!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.580
Finish them off with a missile attack.

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:44.310
Get a good aim on them.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.010
Fire!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.100
All right, don't move!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.700
Move an inch and I'll shoot!

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:12.200
Rita, how dare you betray us!

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:15.100
You know what's coming, so say your prayers!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.180
It's the police!

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.850
That makes things easier for us.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.720
Good timing!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.880
Talk about saving us from a close call!

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:35.150
Officers!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:37.900
W-Wait a minute.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.870
Why'd you lock us up? We're the real ones!

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:41.700
Yeah, yeah.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.600
That's what they all say.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:45.770
We even showed you our ID cards!

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:48.040
ID cards are easy to fake.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.030
Officer!

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:54.150
Why do we have to be locked up, too?
What about the bounty for those two?

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.080
Be quiet!

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:58.420
We're the ones who captured them, not you!

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:03.020
You'll be charged with trying to assassinate
Prince Heace, among other crimes.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.790
We didn't do anything, though.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.090
Ah, Prince!

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:13.230
Hey, Prince, tell him we're
the real Lovely Angels.

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:15.530
You two sure are troublemakers.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.000
There's no doubt you're good people though.

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:19.540
However,

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:23.000
I think it's time you two reflect and find
yourselves a more respectable profession.

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:26.040
Still, I'll never forget you
two for the rest of my life.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.510
Rita said the same thing.

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:30.010
By the way, where is she?

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.920
I have an hour until I leave this planet,

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.390
so I figured I'd go on a quick field trip with her.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:37.620
She's waiting for me.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:41.830
I'll arrange for you to be
released as soon as possible.

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:42.990
Well then, goodbye.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.830
I feel so pathetic!

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:49.970
It's your fault!

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:52.410
Ever since I partnered with you,
you've always been getting me into trouble!

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:54.540
That's my line!

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:56.040
First of all, if you hadn't lost your earrings!

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.240
It's your fault for sending yours in for repair!
First of all, if you hadn't lost your earrings!

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.870
It's your fault for sending yours in for repair!

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:00.410
Oh, let's stop this.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:02.250
We saved the Prince, didn't we?

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:04.190
But what about us?

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:05.850
Be patient, what else?

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:08.360
You always become so calm
in situations like this.

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:10.990
Even though you're always screaming
in my ear when we're in a pinch!

00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:12.360
It'll work out.

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:14.290
Yeah, yeah, I'm sure it will.

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:17.690
I'm telling you, we're the real ones!

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:49.960
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:56.440
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.440 --> 00:23:02.940
I passed through a distant, silvery time tunnel
Giniro haruka na taimu tonneru nukete

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:09.610
And met a wanderer with unclouded eyes
Deatta sunda me no samayoibito

00:23:09.850 --> 00:23:12.020
Space Fantasy

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:16.320
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:18.530
Space Fantasy

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:22.400
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:28.870
Even if you were from another planet,
Tatoeba anata ga betsu no hoshi no hito demo

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:35.240
It wouldn't matter to me, because I've fallen in love
Watashi wa kamawanai aishita nara

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:39.140
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:39.210 --> 00:23:41.880
Dirty, Stormy Destiny

00:23:41.880 --> 00:23:48.310
Love is zero G...
Koi wa mujuuryoku...

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:01.870
Hey, Yuri.

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:02.670
What is it?

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:03.770
Listen to this.

00:24:03.770 --> 00:24:04.500
So...

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:07.070
What?

00:24:07.170 --> 00:24:08.300
I'm trying to tell you.

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:11.480
Huh? Speak up!

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:13.310
Jeez, you're impossible!

00:24:13.480 --> 00:24:15.310
I'm trying to tell you, the next episode is...

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:19.590
"Hah Hah Hah, Dresses and Men
Should Always Be Brand New!"

00:24:19.590 --> 00:24:21.580
This is a secret, right Kei?

